  <para style="h">Xibolai Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Xibolai Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">Xibolai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Xib</para>
  <para style="mt">Xibolai Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Huda Kewonne Tungo Giezhi Kieliewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Gushihoude Huda xienzhilai tungo giezhi mai xienrenlade haojihui, olon banfaghala kieliewo. <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>Duya baraku ene xienzide kewonne tungo giezhi matande kieliewo. Huda hhei soyujilai jienliechen kun danlaghawo. Da hhei tungo giezhi alanni zhayaghawo. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Hheshi Hudai famatui faighachen gon wo. Hudai xinbinni onqiende daibio giezho. Nenlitu kielienghalane yanyanjilai gonjizho. Mai zuini ganjinraghadene undu, fugietu Hudai borun miende souzho. <verse eid="HEB 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Hhe jienliesan niere qienxienlani nierese fama wo. Ingiezhi qienxienlase undudawo.<verse eid="HEB 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hudai Kewon Qienxienlase Hen Wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Huda alinie qienxiende,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">"Chishi mii kewon wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">Enedu bi chade ada danlawo."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">giezhi kieliezhi daozho?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Pse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">"Bi hhende ada danlane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">Hhe made kewon danlane."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">giezhi kieliezhi daozho?<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Pse Huda fugie kewonne duyade ireghakude,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">"Hudai qienxienla, man hhei beii."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:6">giezhi kieliezho.<verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Huda qienxienlani kieliese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">"Huda qienxienlane kei gholughazho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">hojilane khan gholughazho."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:7">giezhi kieliezhoma,<verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>kewonne kieliese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">"Huda, chii baozoshi chanqi izhiku wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Chi gundannighala goyane gojiani gonjizho.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Chi gundannide xiqi wo, doghunnii henjizho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Ingiese Huda, yeshijiu chii Huda chade bayasukui ogizhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">hhantu kunlase daoghawo."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:9">giezho.<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Pse kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">"Ezhan, dei qiikude chi zeminde jichu giewo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">Asimanyiye chi khaghalane giewo.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Zemin, asiman widanema, chi izhi wine.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Hhela man jien mutun khuichenrane.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Chi hhelai jien mutun horo agine.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">Hhela jien mutun bienjinema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Zinie chi niekielien wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">Chanqi amiturane."<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Huda alinie qienxiende,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">"Bi duitoulaichii kon dourachii teitula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">chi mii borun miende sou."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:13">giezhi kieliezhi daozho?<verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Qienxienlashi man zinie ushilachen ruhher wo. Huda peidene jiuikuni jienliene giesan kunlai ushilaghachen wo.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jiuiku Nenjienni Meilade Bu Uzhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Ingiese matan chenliesan daolini ijinyo genjia goude jilakuni wo. Pse daolise wirulane. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Qienxienlai tungo giezhi kieliesan kielien xiogo wine. Jien zui fanjizhi ese shunjisanlai man gundande faiwo. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Ingiese matan imekie fugie jiuikui yamacha ulie teise matugie faikuse andane? Ene jiuikushi Ezhan xien qinsi kieliesan wo, khuinashi Ezhanse chenliesan kunla matande zhenmin giewo. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Hudaye ghudureqi, fugie shiqin, yanyanji nenlitu shiqinghala, pse duranghalane kunlade ghughazhi ogisan Shenlinni nenjienghala hhantu ganzhen beiwo.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mai Jiuichen Ersa Kun Gholuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Matan ede kieliesan jianlaiku duyani Huda qienxienlade jiuizhi ese gonjighazhoma, <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>jinwun jieredu nie oronde ganzhen beizhi kieliezho.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 2:6"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">"Kunshi yan wo, chi dou hhende zhughe chilane?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Kunshi yan wo, chi dou hhei zhaogu giene?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Chi hhei zhanshi jiere qienxienlase boghonidaghawo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">Hhende fama, zhiguitu maghalai zhoghawo.<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>Soyujilai hhei kon doura shunjighawo."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Hhende soyujilai shunjighawo giese hhei uye shunjikui nieda uwoma, ede soyujila hhei shunjisei matan dou chanla dazho. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Matan chanlasanshi qienxienlase zhanshi jiere boghonidasan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> wo. Hhe fuguku kui shouidene fama, zhiguitu maghalai zhowo. Hudai nenjienghala jien kunlade oluzhi fuguzhi daozho.<verse eid="HEB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Soyujilashi Hudade oluzhi, Hudai tungo giezhi bisan wo. Hhe olon kesilane famade udurukude shouku giekughala hhelai jiuiku touzi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i hulunshighase heshi wo. <verse eid="HEB 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Kunlai zhiguishighasan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>, pse hhezighan zhiguishisan kunla man nie Adase irezho. Ingiese hhe hhelai gaijiu giezhi uruse shizhekui uwo. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>Hhe kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">"Bi gaijiuladene chii nierei chonjine.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Bi hhantulasan kunlai dunda chii doulane."<verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Pse kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">"Bi hhei kouine."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Pse kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">"Uzhe, bi, pse Huda made ogisan kesilare enende wine."<verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Ingiese kesilade beye biku mutun hhe goyaneye kunni beye gholuzhi fugukui tungo giedene fugukuni qienlii bareisan Ibilisii widaghawo, <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>pse hhezighan fugukuse ayizhi ibeizi hoji danlasan kunlai andaghawo. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Hhe shuhua qienxienlade banman ese giedene <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>ni houdeilade banman giewo. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Ingiese hhe gofanmiende gaijiularene xianlitui gholuse indanji wo. Ingiekushi Hudai melie ubali xiichen, shixinji giechen zui fugie buwa gholudene kunlai zuini shuine giezho. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Hhei shouku giekughala shiizhi daozho. Ingiese hhe hhezighan shiisan kunlade banman gie shidane.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ersa Musase Hen Wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Ingiese Huda hhantu urusan zhiguitu gaijiula, matan xianxin giesan Huda peisan, zui fugie buwa <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni goude sumula. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Hhe hhei peisan Hudade gieku <char style="pn">Musa</char> mechide shixinji giekughala niekielien wo. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Gie giesan kunde giese kuaikui olon mutun <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de <char style="pn">Musa</char>se kuaikui olon wo. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Gielade man giesan kun winema, soyujilai zhayaghasanshi Huda wo. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/><char style="pn">Musa</char> Hudai gieni soyuji kunlade hoji danladene shixinde giezhi jianlai kielieku shiqinde ganzhen beizhoma, <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Mexiha Hudai giede kewon danlazhi shixinde giezho. Matan danzine fugiedaghazhi panjisanne goude bareise matanshi mechi wo.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hudai Bexinla Hhamuraku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Ingiese Shenlin kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">"Enedu ta Hudai shenqini sonosuse<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>hhe xienzide bexinla hontande Hudai shiizhi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">Zodui gieku mutun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">zhughene bu khiduzhegha.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Tai xienrenla bi 40 nien giesei uzhewoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">yen hhende mii shiizhi kaoyen giewo.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Ingiese bi hhe idai kunlade hokuzhi kieliewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">'Hhelai zhugheni chan miizhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">mii moni tani dane.'<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Bi hokudene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">hhela mii hhamurakude ibeizi oro dane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">giezhi fayen giewo."<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Gaijiula, ta xioxin gie, pse tai dunda niezhan kunla doghun zhugheghala xianxin ulie giedene chanqiku Hudase likai giene. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Shijienni enedu giezhi urukude niudunie nieniene surughazhi kielie, pse tai dunda niezhan kunlai zui miidene zhugheini khiduzheghane. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Matan dei qiikude xianxin giesanne zuihou kutula izhi xiacha giese Mexihare hhantu nexian jienliene. <verse eid="HEB 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Jinwun jiere kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">"Enedu ta Hudai shenqii sonosuse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">hhela zodui gieku mutun zhughene bu khiduzhegha."<verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Hudai shenqii sonosudene hhere zodui giesanshi kien wo? <char style="pn">Musa</char> <char style="png">Aiji</char>se uduruzhi khizhesan soyuji kunla pushonu? <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Huda 40 niende kiende hokuzho? Hhezighan zui fanjidene fugusan beyeni hontande feiliesan kunlade pushonu? <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Mii hhamurakude oro dane giezhi Huda kiende fayen giewo? Hhezighan ese shunjisan kunlade pushonu? <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Matan uzhese hhela hhamurakude oro dakushi xianxin ese giezho.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Ingiese Hudai hhamurakude oroku dain giesan winema, matanyi dunda niezhanla hhamurakude oro dakuse matan ayikui wo. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Hhelade gouxioxii chonjiku mutun matandeye chonjizhoma, hhela daolini chenliekude xianxin giekughala ese jienliezho. Ingiese chenliesan hhelade yama oronde uwo. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Matan xianxin giesan kun hhamurakude orozho. Huda kieliesan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">"Bi hokudene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">hhela mii hhamurakude ibeizi oro dane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">giezhi fayen giewo."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Ingiezhoma, Hudai wilie duyai zhayaghasanse gholuzho. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Jinwun jieredu nie oronde ji 7 qienni ingiezhi kieliezho, "ji 7 qiende Huda soyuji wilielasene hhamurawo." <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Pse enezighande kieliezho, "Hhela mii hhamurakude ibeizi oro dane!" <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Hhamurakude ezighan kunla oronema, eqighandei gouxioxii chenliedene ese shunjisan kunla oro dawo. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Huda pse niekozi udui enedu giezhi jinjidene khuinashi <char style="pn">Dawude</char>i tungo giezhi ene udui kieliezho. Eneshi jiere injisan jinwun wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">"Enedu ta Hudai shenqii sonosuse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">zhughene bu khiduzhegha."<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>
    <char style="pn">Yeshuya</char> hhelade hhamurakui ogizhoshi Huda khuinashi psedu udui ulie kieliene. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Ingiese Hudai bexinlade da nie hhamuraku wine. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Huda wilielane ese giedene hhamuraku mutun Hudai hhamurakude orochen kunla wilielane ese giedene hhamurazho. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Ingiese matan hhe hhamurakude ijinyo xiacha giezhi orokui wo. Pse ese shunjisan hhelai yanzii daghazhi furane.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Hudai kielienshi amitu, zoin bitui wo, yanyanji ghua renzitu khudoghose da xidu wo. Lien kunni jinshen ruhherji mouzi gusuide orozhi ghua gholughane. Zhugheni sumulaku zhuyiniliuzhe fenji shidane. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Zhayaghasan yanliuzhe Hhei melie niuighakui uwo. Man Hhei melie khizhene. Matan hhende ijinyo zhan jiuine.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zui Fugie Buwa Ersa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Matande asimande khisan famatu niekozi zui fugie buwa wine. Hheshi Hudai kewon <char style="pn">Ersa</char> wo. Ingiese matan xianxin giesanne xiacha gieye. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Matanyi zui fugie buwa matanyi zholienni ulie mejiekui uwo. Hhei yandeliuzhe matan mutun shiizhi daozhoma, zui ese fanjizho. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Ingiese matan danzine fugiedaghadene nenjientu baozo melie echiye. Hhende matande ubali xiizhi kerekude banman giene.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Alinie zui fugie buwaliuzhe kun dundase sunghudene kunni oronde Hudai shiqinyi gonjighazho. Hhela Hudade mure ogizhi zuini shuiku sidagha giezho. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Hheladeye gofanmiende zholienni wine. Ingiese yama ulie mejiezhi codasan kunlade renyide giene. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Hhelade zholienni bise bexinlai zuide oluzhi sidagha gieku mutun goya zuideneye indan sidagha giene. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Kiema zui fugie buwani minshenyi goyadene iregha dane, zinie <char style="pn">Hharune</char> mutun Huda sunghuse olune.<verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Niekielien wo. Mexihaye zui fugie buwa danlaku kuaikui goyadene ese ireghazho. Zinie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">chishi mii kewon wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">Enedu bi chade ada danlawo</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 5:5">giesan Huda hhende kuaikui ogizho. <verse eid="HEB 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Jinwun jiere pse nie oronde Huda pse kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">"Chishi <char style="pn">Maijixide</char> mutun chanqiku buwa wo."<verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>
    <char style="pn">Ersa</char> duyade bikude baratazhi wilazhi onxian giezhi goyai fugukuse jiui shidaku Hudai xiahua giezho. Huda hhei xienlian mutun dain giewo. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Hheshi Hudai Kewon woma, ku shouikughala shunjikui suruwo. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Hhe ingiezhi hulunshidene hhei shunjisan soyuji kunlade oluzhi chanqiku jiuiku genzi gholuwo. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Ingie Huda hhei <char style="pn">Maijixide</char> mutun zui fugie buwa danlaghawo.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiomun Jiere Khiduzhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Ene shiqinlai kieliese bijiende kielieku kielien olon woma, ta menshi kieliezhi qinchu olugha dane. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Imegheichade ta loushi danlakui woma, dou Hudai daolini jichui kunla tande sughaku biyo wine. Ta zinie neizi ijiene, khidunni ijie dazho. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Jien neizi ijiechenshi yeliwa wo, yanshi gou daoli bikui ulie mejiene. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Zinie fugiedasanla khidunni ijiene. Hhelai lienjizhi daose gouni, roni fenji shidane.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1-2"/>Ingiese matan Mexihani daolii kaishi giekui khuinane jiedene, fugughaku wilielai geizhen gieku, Hudai xianxin gieku, xilini surughaku, kha teizhi onxian gieku, fugusan kun aminne oluku, zuihou shenpan gieku enezighan jichulai pse bu daidene hulunshikude daiye. <verse eid="HEB 6:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Huda dain giese matan hulunshikude daine. <verse eid="HEB 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Hhezighan gon zhouidene niefa giegherezhi, asimanni nenjienni jingo giezhi, Shenlinni xianshou giezhi, <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>Hudai kielien gou biku, houshini famani jingo giezhi daosan kunla <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>zhendaoni bendase hhela erchan shinishizhi geizhen gie dane. Qinsi Hudai kewonyi pse shizijia jiere ghadazhi minminji shizheghazho.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Nie ghazha chan bousan ghurai xiidene cai osizhi tareisan kunde zoin bise Hudase fuqi irene. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Ghazhade eghesun, osun osise yama zoin widazho, kharaku ghujinlazhi zuihoude siderane.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Bijienyi orentula, ingiezhi kieliezhoma, tai qinkonla goudazhi jiuikuse chadashisei bijien hende xianxin giezho. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Hudashi gundan wituni pusho. Ta giesan wilie, pse hhei nierede oluzhi oresanlai ese matazho. Eneshi ta eqighandei shentulai zhaogu giezhi edeliuzhe ushilazho. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Bijien xiwon giese ta kienliuzhe panjisanla man gholutula niekielienji rexinde giezhi zuihoude kuru. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Ingiese ta ulie langanshizhi hhezighan xianxin giedene rennai giezhi dain giesanyi jienliesan kunlanughunyi surune.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hudai Dain</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Huda <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de dain giekude goyasene fugienii zhiizhi fayen giekui uwoshi goyane zhiizhi fayen giezhi kieliewo, <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>"Bi ijinyo chade fuqi olon ogizhi houdeilaichii hende olodoghane." <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> oloncha rennai giedene dain giesei jienliewo. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Kun fayen giekude goyasene fugienii zhiizhi fayen giene. Ene fayenyi ganzhen beighazhi soyuji zhenjindusei widaghane. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Hhezighan dain giesei jienliesan kunlade Huda goya isine ibeizi ulie bienjighakui pse qinchude mejieghane giezhi dain giedene pse fayen giezhi bouzhen giewo. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Ene ghua shiqin ulie bienjine. Huda ghudan ulie kieliene. Ingiese matan Hudai miende piile iresan kunla hende bayasuzhi melie beilasan xiwonni goude barei shidane. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Matande bisan ene xiwon hoxian matanyi ruhherde olusan chon beighaku gougoui xianli, khidunji undan wo. Dajienyi sudorodu menlienzi sudoro matanyi oroghane. <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> <char style="pn">Maijixide</char> mutun chanqiku zui fugie buwa gholudene matande oluzhi tou 1 giede sudorodu menlienzi sudoro orowo.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Hudai Buwa Maijixide</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Ene <char style="pn">Maijixide</char>shi <char style="png">Salen</char>ni honshan wo, pse Zui Undu Hudai buwa wo. <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> honshanlai eghi injidene khareizhi irekude <char style="pn">Maijixide</char> hhei jienliezhi gouni kieliezho. <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/><char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> eghinduzhi zhanjisan soyujilasene ushireini hhende ogizho. <char style="pn">Maijixide</char>i niereni tou 1 gie isishi gundan honshan wo, pse <char style="png">Salen</char> honshan wo, jiushi pinnantu honshan wo. <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Hhende ada, ana jiawu uwo. Hhei aminde qiorun, uzhu uwo. Hhe Hudai kewonyi xianli, chanqi buwa danlazho.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Ta nie sumula, ene kun matu fama wo! Famatu xienren <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> qianlazhi iresanne ushireini hhende ogiwo. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/><char style="pn">Liwi</char>ni houdei dunda buwa danlachen kunla bexinlase ushirei ghura giezhi guijinde minlin ogizho. Ene bexinshi <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>se khizhesan hhelai gaijiuliuzhe buwala hhelase yen qingiezhi ghurazhoma, <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/><char style="pn">Maijixide</char>shi hhelare nie jiawu pusho, khareidene <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>se ushirei ghurazhi Hudai dainni jienliesan <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de onxian giezho. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Fugieni ganide onxian giese yama kieliekui uwo. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Ushirei ghurasan buwala fugunema, <char style="pn">Maijixide</char> jinwun jiere kieliesan mutun chanqi ulie fugune. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Ingiezhi kielieseye olune. Ushirei ghurasan <char style="pn">Liwi</char> goyane <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>i tungo giezhi ushirei ogizho. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Ingiekushi <char style="pn">Maijixide</char> <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>i jienliekude <char style="pn">Liwi</char> xienrenne yasunde wo.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>
    <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla <char style="png">Liwi</char> paini buwai zhidui doura guijinni jienliewo. Ene zhiduni tungo giezhi hulunshise yale <char style="pn">Hharune</char>ni zhidui ese daghadene <char style="pn">Maijixide</char>i zhidui daghasan da nie buwai khizheghazho? <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Buwani zhidui geise guijinniye ijinyo geine. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Ede kieliesan hheshi da nie painughun wo. Hhe paini kunla sidagha gieku teizi shida wilie giezhi nieda ese daozho. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Matanyi Ezhan <char style="pn">Yuda</char> paise khizhesanyi man mejiene. Ene paini kieliekude <char style="pn">Musa</char> buwai shiqinyi qiizhi ese daozho.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>
    <char style="pn">Maijixide</char> mutun pse nie buwa khizhese ene shiqinla genjia qinchu oluwo. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Hhe buwa danlakushi <char style="pn">Liwi</char> paise khizhene giesan guijinghala pusho, ulie widaku aminni nenlighala wo. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Jinwun jiere hhende ganzhen beizhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">"Chishi <char style="pn">Maijixide</char> mutun chanqiku buwa wo."<verse eid="HEB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Niemande kieliese melieshidaku minlin zholien, yama zoin wise widaghawo. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Guijin yamai ese hulunshighawo. Pse niemande kieliese matande gou xiwon irezho. Ene xiwonyi tungo giezhi matan Hudai shigha shidane.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Pseshi <char style="pn">Ersa</char> buwa danlakude Huda fayen giezhi danlaghazho. Psedu buwalashi fayen giezhi danlaghasan pusho, <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>zinie <char style="pn">Ersa</char>shi fayen giezhi danlaghasan wo. Huda hhende kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">"Ezhan fayen giezho, pse ulie bienjine.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">Chishi chanqiku buwa wo."<verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>
    <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni fayen giezhi buwa danlaghase hheshi genjia gou yenjisanni baoran gholuwo.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Eqighandei buwa danlasan shuzi olon bikushi hhela man fugune. Ingiese izhigie buwa danla dazho. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Zinie <char style="pn">Ersa</char> chanqi wine. Ingiese hhei buwai wiliei chanqi ulie arunzhane. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Hhe chanqi amiturazhi hhelade oluzhi xiahua giezho. Ingiese jien hhei tungo giezhi Hudai melie iresanlai hhe jiuizhi uzhu kurugha shidane.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Intu zhiguitu, doghunnii wiku, zannannii wiku, zuirense ghugha keisan, asimanlase undudasan zui fugie buwa matande jian heshi wo. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>Hhe psedu buwala mutun niudunie goyane zuide sidagha giedene khuinashi bexinlani zuide sidagha gieku biyo uwo. Hhe goyane 1 huide sidagha giedene enei man chenjighawo. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Guijinghala zui fugie buwa danlasanlade man zholienni winema, guijinni khuina Huda fayen giezhi chanqi hulunni gholusan Kewonne buwa danlaghawo.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Matanni Zui Fugie Buwa Ersa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Ede kieliesan zhunyonishi matande intu nie zui fugie buwa wine. Hhe asiman jieredu famatu Hudai baozoi borun miende souzho. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Ganjin oronde, yeshijiu zhenzhenji zhanfande wilie giezho. Ene zhanfanshi kun daisan pusho, Ezhan daisan wo. <verse eid="HEB 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Jien zui fugie buwalashi mure ogizhi sidagha gieghane giezhi danlaghasan wo. Ingiese matanyi ene nie zui fugie buwaye yama ogiku dunxi kerene. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Hhe zemin jiere bise buwa ulie danlakushi guijin mutun sidagha giechen buwala wine. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Enezighan buwala giesan wilieshi asiman jieredu shiqinni yanzi wo, xiujie wo. <char style="pn">Musa</char> ganjin zhanfanni daine giekude Huda jingao giezhi kieliesan mutun, "Chi xioxin giezhi yanyanji giekulai bi chade ulade uzheghasan yanzi mutun gie." <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> ede genjia zhiguitu wiliei jienliewo. Hheshi genjia gou yenjisanyi dundadu kun wo. Eneshi genjia gou dain jiere jinjisan wo.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Ji 1 gie yenjisande yama ese chaizhoshi ji 2 gie yenjisanyi kereku biyo uwo. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Huda hhelai kheilazhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">"Uzhe, bi <char style="png">Isilie</char> kun, <char style="png">Yuda</char> kunlare shini yenjisanyi jinjiku udu khuzhene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">Eneshi Ezhan kieliesan wo.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Ene yenjisanshi bi hhelai xienrenlaini khai laizhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="png">Aiji</char>se uduruzhi khizhekude</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Hhelare jinjizhi yenjisanghala buxian wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">Hhela mii yenjisanyi izhi ese zunjizho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Ingiese biye hhelai ese gonjiwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">Eneshi Ezhan kieliesan wo.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Hhezighan udu daose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">bi <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlare jinjiku yenjisanshi ingiezho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Bi guijinne hhelai sumulakude teizhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">zhughedeni huaine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Bi hhelade Huda danlane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Hhela made bexin danlane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Eneshi Ezhan kieliesan wo.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Jien kunla giebeizi, gaijiuladene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">chi ezhanni tani giezhi surughaku biyo uwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Zui ganise zui fugienide kurutula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">man mii tanine.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Bi hhelai codasanyi rouliene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">Hhelai zuini pse ulie jilane."<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>"Shini yenjisan" giezhi kieliese melieshiku khuichenrazho. Khuichenrazhi bixindasanla deigo man widane.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Zeminji Asiman Jieredu Libai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Tou 1 gie yenjisan kieliende beiiku guijin, duya jiereshiku beiiku zhiguitu oron wine. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Nie dai goudaghasan ganjin zhanfanni tou 1 gie giei zhiguitu oron giezhi uruzho. Sudoro zhula teizi, shire, Hudade ogiku ginan wine. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Ji 2 gie menlienzi khuina nie gie wine, zui zhiguitu oron giezhi uruzho. <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>Sudoro antanghala giesan xianlu shire, pse antanghala man bouisan yenjisan kielienni xianzi wine. Xianzi sudoro mana ginan zhonlosan antan gongon, <char style="pn">Hharune</char>ni niazi faizhi daosan zhugun, ghua yenjisan tashi banzi wine. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Xianzi jiere famatu ghua Jilubo wine. Zui widaghaku teizii huizho. Ede enelai nienieji kielie dane.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Enelai ingiezhi zhunbei gie goudaghazho. Buwala ganjin zhanfanni tou 1 gie giede chan orozhi libai gieku wilie giezho. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Ji 2 gie giede zinie zui fugie buwa niehon 1 hui orozhi chusun bareidene goyai zuide oluzhi, pse bexinla mejie dazhi fanjisan zuide oluzhi sidagha giene. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Enelai tungo giezhi Shenlin mejieghakushi tou 1 gie gie bikude zui zhiguitu oronde echiku moni da ese keighazho. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Eneshi edeku yanzi wo. Mure ogizhi sidagha giese libai giesan kunyi lianxinni hulunshigha dane. <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Hhezighan ijieku, ochiku, yanyanji waghakulashi mienzide jinjisan guijin wo, arunzhazhi shinishighaku shihou kurune.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Mexiha iredene ireku gou shiqinni zui fugie buwa danlazhi genjia fugie, genjia hulunshiku ganjin zhanfanni tungo giezho. Ene ganjin zhanfanshi kunni khaghala daisan pusho, ene zhayaghasan duyanughunye pusho. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Hhe iman, fughe tughuchai chusunyi ulie injizhi goya chusunne injidene 1 huide zui zhiguitu oronde orozhi chanqi zui shuikui chenjighawo. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Iman, jieniui chusun, pse siniu tughuchai funiesunyi ganjin witu kunyi jiere xireighazhi beyei arughazhi ganjinraghase <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Mexiha chanqiku Ruhherni tungo giezhi goyane goujida zannan wizhi Hudade ogise hhei chusun fugughaku shiqinse tai lianxinni zhiguishighazhi tai chanqiku Hudai genjia ulie shunjighanu?<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Ene yenyin jiere hhe shini yenjisei dundadu kun danlazho. Hhe fuguzhi kunla tou 1 giede yenjisan doura fanjisan zuini shuiwo. Ingiedene hhezighan uruzhi iresan kunlade dain giesan chanqiku jiachanni jienlieghawo. <verse eid="HEB 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Kiende fugukude kielieku kielien bise bixi kielien liuisan kun fugusei kunla zhenmin gie. <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Kun fuguse yenjisan kielien caigie zoin wine. Yenjisan kun amitushi yenjisan kielien yama zoin uwo. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Ingiese tou 1 gie yenjisanniye chusunghala jinjizho. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/><char style="pn">Musa</char> guijin mutun bexinlade soyuji minlinni jianjidene hulan noghosun, osun ganganni bareizhi fughe tughucha, imanni chusun, usui guijinshu, pse bexinlai jiere xireighazhi <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>"Ene chusunshi Huda tanre jinjisan yenjisan kielienyi zhenji wo." giezhi kieliezho. <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Niekielien wo. Chusunni ganjin zhanfan, yanyanji libai giekude injiku dunxi jiere xireighazho. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Guijin mutun chabudu soyujilai chusunghala ganjinraghazho. Chusun ese usuruzhoshi zuini mienlie dane.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mexiha Fuguzhi Kunlani Zuini Widaghawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Ingiese asiman jieredu yanzi mutun giesan dunxilai bixi ingiezhi ganjinraghazhoma, asiman jieredu dunxilai genjia gou sidagha giekughala ganjinraghane. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Mexiha zhenzhenji zhiguitu oronni xiujie, yejiushi kun khaghala giesan zhiguitu oronde ese orodene asimande orozhi ede mai oronde Hudai melie khizhezho. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Hhe goyane izhigie sidagha gieku biyo uwo. Zui fugie buwa niehonnie goyane chusunyi ese bareizhi psedu chusunyi bareizhi zui zhiguitu oronde orokughala buxian wo. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Qingiese hhe duyai zhayaghasanse bixi izhigie ku shouinema, ede goyane 1 huide sidagha giezhi zuini widaghane giezhi duyai zuihoukude xienjizhi khizhewo. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Jien kunla 1 hui fugukushi jinjisan wo. Fuguse panjine. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>Mexihaye olon kunlai zuini danjine giezhi goyane niefade sidagha giewo. Jianlai ji 2 hui xienjizhi khizhezhi zuini danjikughala gonxi widene hhei hende sagheisan kunlai jiuine.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Guijinshi jianlai ireku gounii xiujie wo, zhenzhenji yanzi pusho. Ingiese niehonnie niekielienji sidagha giekughala Hudai melie iresan kunlai jiedui hulunshigha dane. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Hulunshigha shidase libai giesan kunlai 1 huide ganjinraghazhi pse lianxinni zui wine giezhi ulie giene. Ingiese sidagha gieku eqighan ulie beinu? <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Ingieliuzhe enezighan sidagha gieku niehonnie kunni zuini jila ireghane. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Jieniu, imanni chusun zuini widagha dane.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Ingiese Mexiha duyade irekude Hudade kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">"Sidagha gieku dunxi, murelai chi ese keredene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">mii beyeni mure danlaghane giezhi zhunbei giewo.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Sideraghaku sidagha, shuiku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">sidaghade chi xiqi uwo.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Ingiekude bi kieliewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">'Huda, jinwun jiere mii zhiizhi huaisan mutun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">bi chii isii giele irezho.'"<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Jiere Mexiha kieliezhi "Sidagha gieku, mure, sideraghaku sidagha, shuiku sidaghani chi ese kerezho, xiqiye uwo." giezho. Enezighanshi guijin mutun ogisan wo. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Ingiedene kieliezho, "Uzhe, bi chii isii giele irezho." Ingiekushi hhe melieshikui widaghazhi khuinashikui chenjighane giezho. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Ene isi mutun <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha beyene 1 huide sidagha giezhi matanyi zhiguishighawo.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Jien buwala niudunie beidene wilie giezhi niekielienji sidagha giezhoma, eneghala zuini ibeizi widagha dane. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Zinie Mexiha 1 huide zui shuiku sidagha giezhi chanqi zoin khizheghazho. Ingiedene Hudai borun miende souzhi <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>hhei duitoulai hhei kon doura teitula sagheizho. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Hhe 1 hui sidagha giedene zhiguishisan kunlai chanqi hulunshighawo.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Shenlinye matande ganzhen beizhi kieliezho,<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>"Ezhan kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Hhezighan udu daose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">bi hhelare jinjiku yenjisanshi ingiezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Bi guijinne hhelai zhughede teizhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">sumulakudeni huaine."<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Pse kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">"Hhelai zuini, mouxiennilai pse ulie jilane."<verse eid="HEB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Enezighan zuini mienliese pse zuide sidagha gieku biyo uwo.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hudai Melie Echiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Ingiese gaijiula, matan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni chusunyi tungo giezhi fugie danzighala zui zhiguitu oronde oro shidane. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Hhe matande nie shini, amitu moni keighazhi sudorodu menlienzighun daoghawo. Ene sudorodu menlienzishi hhei beye wo. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Matande Hudai giede gonjisan nie famatu buwa wineshi <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>matai doghun lianxinni <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i chusunghala arughazhi zhughei ganjinraghadene beyeni ganjin usughala waghase matan shixinji zhughe, khidunde xianxin giekughala Hudai melie echiye. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Matande dain giesan hheshi kekaotui wo. Ingiese matan chenren giezhi xiwon giesei ulie gojiolughazhi goude bareiye. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Matan nieniene dahoshen giezhi oreku, gounii giekui sumulaye. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Hhezighan ulie hhantulazhi gon olusan kunlai bu daghadene nieniedene surughazhi kieliezhi hhantulaye. Hhe udu chadashisei mejiese genjia ingiezhi gieye.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Matan zhendaoi mejiekui jienliesenu nanxighan zui fanjise pse shuiku sidagha uwo, <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>zinie ayizhi panjiku, pse duitoulai sideraghaku fugie khanni sagheizho. <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/><char style="pn">Musa</char>i guijinyi fanjisan kunlai ghua, ghuran kun ganzhen beise ubali ulie xiizhi fugughanema, <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Hudai kewonyi taizhi goyai zhiguishighasan yenjisan chusunyi yamacha ese teizhi nenjienni ogisan Shenlinni uru giesan kunlai, ta nie sumula, hhelai genjia gundude ulie fainu? <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>"Bouchoushi bi giekui wo, bi kharulune." Pse, "Ezhan bexinlane panjine." Enei kien kieliesei matan mejiene. <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Chanqiku Hudai khade orose ayine.<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Tai eqighandei gon zhouidene jiurezhi olon ku shouizhi rennai giesei sumula. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Niezheifa tai dajialai melie shizheghazhi heizho. Niezheifa qimutu kunnan shouisan kunlare lienshou gholuzho. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Hhezighan khasan kunlade ta ubali xiizho. Tai caichanlai kunla qianlakude ta bayasuzhi shouikushi goyade genjia gouni, chanqiku caichan bikui mejiene. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Ingiese ta fugie danzine bu benda. Intu zhughede fugie jianli ogine. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Ta Hudai isii gie baraghazhi dain giesei jienliene giese rennai gieku biyo wine.<verse eid="HEB 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Jinwun jiere, "Pse goujicha beise</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">irene giesan hhe irene, ulie udane.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Gou kunmi xianxin giekughala amiturane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">Khuina tuise bi hhende xiqi uwo." giezhi kieliezho.<verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Matanshi khuina tuidene widachen kun pusho, xianxin gieku bizhi jiuisan kun wo.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Xianxin Gieku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Xianxin giekushi xiwon giesan shiqinni bawo wo, chanla daku shiqinni ghanghanaghakui wo. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Eneghala Huda eqighanku kunlai renjizho.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Xianxin giekughala matan alanshi Hudai kielienyi tungo giezhi zhayaghasei mejiene. Ingiezhi chanlasanshi chanla dakuse zhayaghasan wo.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="pn">Hhabi</char> Hudade sidagha giesan <char style="pn">Jiabi</char> giesanse gou wo. Hhei xianxin giekughala Huda mureini jienliezhi <char style="pn">Hhabi</char>shi gou kun wo giezhi renjiwo. Hhe fuguzhoma, xianxin giekughala edeliuzhe kielien kieliezho. <verse eid="HEB 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="pn">Idileisi</char>i jienlie echise hhe fugukui jingo ese giewo. Kunla hhei ereizhi olu dakushi Huda hhei jienlie echizho. Hhei jienlie echiku melie hhe Hudai bayasughase gou minshenyi jienliewo. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Xianxin gieku wise Hudai bayasugha dane. Hudai melie irechen kun ijinyo Huda winekui xianxin giezhi hhei ereisan kunlade jianli ogikui xianxin giekui wo. <verse eid="HEB 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="pn">Nuhha</char> chanla dasan shiqinni Huda jingao giese zunjizhi fugie chonni zhunbei giedene giei kunlaini man jiuiwo. Xianxin giekughala <char style="pn">Nuhha</char> hhe idai kunlai zuini jinjiwo, goyai Hudai melie gounide sanawo.<verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Huda <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>i urukude hhe xianxin giekughala minlinyi zunjizhi jianlai caichan gieku oronde khizhewoma, echikude khala echikui ulie mejiene. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Hhe xianxin giekughala dain giesan oronde soukude kunlai oronde souku mutun zhanfande souzho. Niekielienji dain giesei jienliesan <char style="pn">Isaghei</char>, <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>ye qingiezho. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Eneshi hhe Huda jihua giezhi beighasan jichutu chenshii sagheizho. <verse eid="HEB 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="pn">Sare</char> kewosi laiku nasunse daoliuzhe kewosi laizho. Hhe sumulase hhende dain giesan hhe kekao wo giezho. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Ingiese hoxian nie fugusan kunse houdei oluzhi asiman jieredu hodun, haibienzini shazi mutun shuzi uwo.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Enezighan kunlade man xianxin gieku bizhi fuguwoma, dain giesei jienlie dazho. Gholose dain giesei chanladene bayasuzhi jienliene giezho. Pse goyalane duya jieredu toreichen, zhanshi sousan kun wo giezhi chenren giezho. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Intui kieliechen kunshi minminji goyadene nie gojia ereizho. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Hhela likai giesan oronne sumulazhoshi khareizhi echiku jihui winema, <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>hhela hende xiwon giesanshi nie genjia gou gojia, jiushi asiman jieredu wo. Hhela Hudai Huda giese Huda shizhene ulie giedene hhelade nie chenshini zhunbei giezho.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>i Huda shiikude <char style="pn">Isaghei</char>ni khughozhi ogiwo. Dain giesei jienliesan kun goya niekozi kewonneliuzhe khughozhi ogiwo. <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>Ene kewonni kieliese Huda kieliezhi daozho, "Zinie <char style="pn">Isaghei</char>se olusei chii houdei giezhi urune." <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Hhe sumulase Huda kunni fugusan kun dundase aminne olughane giezho. Hoxian hhe fugusan kun dundase kewonne uduru irewo. <verse eid="HEB 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="pn">Isaghei</char> jianlaiku shiqinde oluzhi <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>, <char style="pn">Isao</char>de onxian giewo. <verse eid="HEB 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="pn">Yagebu</char> fugukude <char style="pn">Yusufu</char>ni kewonlade nienieji onxian giezhi zhugun tuludene Hudai beiiwo. <verse eid="HEB 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="pn">Yusufu</char> fugukude <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla jianlai <char style="png">Aiji</char>se khizhekui kieliezhi pse goya yasunyi matui chuli giekui fenfulawo.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>
    <char style="pn">Musa</char>i oluse ada, anani uzhese nie seighan kewosi wo. Xianxin giekughala honshanni minlinse ese ayizhi ghuran sara niuighawo. <verse eid="HEB 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="pn">Musa</char> fugiedadene <char style="pn">Falao</char>ni oqinde kewon ulie danlane giezho. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Khareidene Hudai bexinlare hhantu shouku gieliuzhe zui dunda zhanshi xianshou ulie giene. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Hhe Mexihade oluzhi uru giesei uzhedan <char style="png">Aiji</char>ni boubeise gundude uzhezho. Hhe jianlaiku jianlini sagheizho. <verse eid="HEB 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Xianxin giekughala hhe honshan hokukuse ese ayizhi <char style="png">Aiji</char>se likai giewo. Chanla daku Ezhanyi hoxian chanlaku mutun rennai giezho. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Xianxin giekughala hhe Jiulidaosan Jie, chusun xireighaku kuichenni jinjiwo. Ingiezhi hhe alachen irese <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlai fugie kewonlai ese alaghazho. <verse eid="HEB 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla <char style="png">Hunhai</char>ni daokude khosun oron daoku niekielien wo. <char style="png">Aiji</char> kunla qingiezhi shiizhi daokude yenji alawo. <verse eid="HEB 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Xianxin giekughala <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla <char style="png">Yelige</char> chenshini doludu rouise chenqian furawo. <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Xianxin giekughala biozi <char style="pn">Lahe</char> tewulai goude jienliedene hhezighan ese shunjisan kunlare hhantu ese fuguwo.<verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Bi pse yan kieliene? <char style="pn">Jijien</char>, <char style="pn">Balake</char>, <char style="pn">Cansun</char>, <char style="pn">Yefuta</char>, <char style="pn">Dawude</char>, <char style="pn">Samuer</char>, pse xienzhilai shiqinni nienieji kieliese shijie ulie kune. <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>Xianxin giekughala hhela gojialai hanshiliewo, gundanni giewo, dain giesei jienliewo, shizini amanyi duighawo, <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>fugie khanni tuliekui widaghawo, khudogho renzise holu andawo, zholiennise khidunnii gholuwo, zhan eghikude lihaishiwo, niman kunlai buduilai man eghi tuighawo. <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Biereila fugusan dundase aminne olusan giene kunyi jienliewo. Niezhan kunla genjia gou fuhoni jienliene giezhi hende tendun shouizhi andaku duran uwo. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Niezhan kunlai xilun gie, mabienzida, banla, kha, <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>tashida ala, qiroujie ala, khudoghoghala alawo. Ghoni, iman arasunyi zhozhi gochude holu, nanxin duru, heikui shoui, zayala, <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>hontan, ula, dun, nokiende liulan giezho. Ene duya hhelai pei dane.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Enezighan kunla xianxin giekui tungo giezhi gou minshenyi jienliewoma, dain giesei jienlie dawo. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Eneshi Huda matande genjia gou shiqin zhunbei giezho. Matan uwoshi hhela hulunshi dane.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ersani Yanzii Suruku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Olien matai wiqiku mutun matande imegheni ganzhen beisan kun wine. Ingiese yanyanji achan, matai chigharade jiohoro giesan zuini xieidene rennai giezhi matai melie beilasan holukui bisai gieye. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Mai xianxin giekuni kaishi gieghazhi onchen gieghasan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni goude uzheye. Hhei melie beilasan bayasukude oluzhi hhe shizijiani kui shouizhi shizheghakui meilade uzhedene Hudai baozoi borun miende souzho. <verse eid="HEB 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Ta zuirenla fandui giesei rennai giesan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i ta goude sumula. Ingiese ta ulie hhechezhi zhughe ulie widane.<verse eid="HEB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Ta zuighala eghinduzhoma, chusun usuruku chendude ese kuruzho. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Kewosiladene surughazhi kieliesan mutun Huda tande surughazhi kieliesan kielienyi ta matawu? Kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">"Mii kewon, Ezhan gonjizhi surughasei chi meilade bu uzhe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">Hhe kheilakude zhughene bu widagha.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Ezhan oresandene gonjizhi surughane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">Jienliesan kesilane eghine."<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Tai gonjizhi surughakude rennai gie. Huda tai kewonne mutun uzhezho. Alinie kewonde ada gonjizhi ulie surughane? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Kewon danlasanla man gonjizhi surughasei jienliezho. Tande gonjizhi surughasan uwoshi kewon pusho, zagieda wo. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Pse matanyi gonjizhi surughasan beyeni adai matan zunjizho. Matan ruhherni Adai genjia shunjizhi ulie amituranu? <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Beyeni ada zhanshi jiere goyane isighala mai gonjizhi surughazho. Zinie ruhherni Ada mai gonjizhi surughakushi matande haochu ireghazhi hhei zhiguinide guzi beighane giezho. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Jien gonjizhi surughasanlashi danshi ese bayasudene nango giezhoma, khuinashi lienjizhi daosan kunlade pinnantu jiego irene, gundande udu daone.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Ingiese ta lilian witu kha, zholieresan shigharane zhidagha. <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Kondene oluzhi moni giezhi zhidagha, ingiese dogholosan shighara ulie banjizhi goudane.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nenjien Ogisan Hudai Bu Benda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Ta soyuji kunlare heqishizhi zhiguide udu daokui xiacha gie. Zhigui uwoshi kiema Ezhanni chanla dane. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Ta xioxin gie, pse niezhan kunla Hudai nenjiense likai giene, pse du winetu genzi khizhedene tai jiohoro giezhi olon kunlai zannanshighane. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Lon kijiezhi <char style="pn">Isao</char> mutun xienlian wizhi gouji idun ijiunide oluzhi fugie kewonni qienlii huine. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Ta mejiene. Hhe khuinashi adani onxian giesei jienliene giese adani dain ese giezho. Wilazhi xiahua gieliuzhe adane zhughei khareighaku banfa widazho.<verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Ta maqi shidaku, khan sidera, olien khi, kharani, honfen kei, <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>laba shenqi, kielien kieliesan shenqitu ulade ese irezho. Hhe shenqii sonosusan kunla pse kielien bu kielie giezhi Hudade xiahua giezho. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>Ene ulani shighasanlai yewoiliuzhe tashida ala giesan minlinni hhela danji dazho. <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Chanlasan zhenzhenji ayighase <char style="pn">Musa</char>liuzhe, "Bi hende ayizhi pugharazho." giezhi kieliezho.<verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Ingiezhoma, ta <char style="png">Xiwunshan</char>, chanqiku Hudai chenshide irezho. Hheshijiu asiman jieredu <char style="png">Yelusalen</char> wo, shuzi witu qienxienla bayasuzhi hhantulasan hhende wo. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Ta asiman jiere nierei jilasan fugie kewonlai jiohui, soyujilai panjichen Hudai hhende irezho. Hulunshighasan gou kunni ruhherlai hhende wo. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Ta shini yenjisei dundadu kun <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i hhende, xireighasan chusunyi hhende irezho. Ene chusun kieliesan <char style="pn">Hhabi</char>ni chusun kieliesanse genjia gou wo.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Ta xioxin giezhi tande kielien kieliesan hhei fandui bu gie. Eqighandei <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla zemin jiere goyalai jingao giesei fandui giedene zuise anda dazho, asiman jierese matanyi jingao giesei fandui giese matan zuise matugie andane? <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Hhe xienzide hhei shenqi zeminyi gojiolughazho. Ede hhe dain giezhi kieliezho, "Bi pse niefa zeminyi gojiolughazhi asimanyiye gojiolughane." <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Pse niefa giesan ene kielienni isishi gojiolughasanlai, yejiushi zhayaghasanlai noighazhi ulie gojiolusanlai feilieghane giezho. <verse eid="HEB 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Ingiese matan ulie gojioluku gojiani jienliese mafan gieye. Xienlian, zunjiku zhugheghala Hudai bayasughazhi beiiye. <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>Matai Hudashi sidera widaghaku khan wo.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Hudai Bayasughaku Wilie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Ta gaijiudene mutun chan nieniedene ore. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Mo yosan zhochenlai goude jienliekui bu mata. Niezhan kunla ingiezhi giezhi mejie dakude qienxienlai jienliezhi daozho. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Bafanzide khasan kunlai goyalarene hhantu khasan mutun jila. Heisan kunlai goyai heisan mutun jila. <verse eid="HEB 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Jien kunla hunyenni zunzhun giezhi bu ghudandu. Lon kijiezhi piofen giesanlai Huda panjine. <verse eid="HEB 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Ta udu daokude baerlai tanxin bu gie. Goyade bisanlashi kurusanni wo gie. Huda kieliezhi daozho, "Bi chii jiedui ulie jiezhi ulie bendane." <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Ingiese matan danzine fugiedaghazhi kieliene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">"Ezhanshi made banman giesan wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Bi ulie ayine.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Kun mii yan giene?"<verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Tande Hudai kielienyi jianjizhi tai udurusanlai jila. Hhela zuihou kurutula giesanlaini goude uzhezhi xianxin gieseini daghazhi gie. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha uchughudu, enedu, chanqi niekielien wo. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Ta goyalane yanyanji ghudureku sughasande bu echigha. Kunni zhughe ijiuni xigonde ulie kouidene nenjiende kouizhi khiduzhese gou wo. Hhezighan ijiuni xigonyi daghasanlade yama haochu uwo. <verse eid="HEB 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Matande nie sidagha gieku teizi wine, jieredu sidagha giesan dunxilai ganjin zhanfande wilie giesan buwala ijieku qienli uwo. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Chushenni chusunyi zui fugie buwa deilazhi zhiguitu oronde orodene zuini shuiku sidagha giezho. Chushenni beyei kunla sousan oronni ghadane sideraghazho. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Ene yenyin jiere <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ye goya chusunghalane bexinlai zhiguishighane giezhi chenmen ghadane ku shouizho. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Ingiese matan kunla sousan oronni ghadanedu hhei hhende echizhi uru giesanyini danjiye. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Matande chanqiku chenshi enende uwo, matan jianlai ireku chenshini sagheizho. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Ingiese matan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi doulakughala Hudade chan sidagha gieye. Eneshijiu Ezhanni nierei chenren giesan kunni amanse khizhekuni wo. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Gouni gieku, nieniedene ogikui bu mata. Imutu xienjide Huda xiqi wo.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Tai udurusan kunlai ta chenliezhi shunji. Hhela Hudai melie zhan jiuine giezhi tai ruhherde oluzhi chan zhughe chilazho. Hhela ingiekude ta munan bu gieghadene bayasughazhi giegha. Hhelai munan gieghase tande yama haochu uwo.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Bijiende oluzhi onxian gie. Bijienyi lianxinde ese chaisei bijien xianxin giene. Bijien yan shiqindeliuzhe gundande giene giezho. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Bi tande goude kielieye, ta hende onxian gie, ingiese bi ghujighande tai hhende khareizhi echine.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gounii Kieliezhi Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Ghoni adulasan fugie yanbashi mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai chanqi yenjisan chusunghala fugusan kun dundase aminne olughasan pinnantu Huda <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>yanyanji gounighala tai hulunshighazhi goyane isii giegha gie! <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani tungo giezhi mai dunda goyane bayasughaku shiqinyi giegha gie. Kuaikui chanqi izhi hhende ogi. Amine!<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Gaijiula, bi jiendanghan tande xin huaizhi sughazhi kieliesei ta goude chenlie. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Matai gaijiu <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ni andaghasei ta mejie. Hhe eqie irese bi hhere hhantu tai uzhele ireye.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Tai udurusan soyuji kun, shentulade man kielien asa. <char style="png">Idali</char>se iresan kunla tai asazho. <verse eid="HEB 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Nenjien tanre man hhantu bi gie!<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
